---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="About | Larkmeadow Lawn Care, Raleigh"
  description="Larkmeadow Lawn Care was started in 2015 by Owen and Talia Brandt with one mower and a pickup. Today four crews mow across Raleigh and the Triangle."
>
  <section class="wrap page-head">
    <h1>One mower, one pickup, and a lot of Saturdays</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Owen Brandt started mowing his neighbors' yards in 2015 to pay for his last year at NC State.
      His wife Talia ran the schedule from the kitchen table. Ten years later, four crews mow across
      the Triangle and Talia still runs the schedule.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="band band--white">
    <div class="wrap split">
      <div>
        <h2>The promise hasn't changed</h2>
        <p class="lede" style="margin-top:1rem">
          The first customers didn't care about fancy equipment. They wanted someone who showed up
          on the same day and did the edges every time. That's still the job.
        </p>
      </div>
      <ul class="ruled">
        <li>
          <h3>Same crew, same day</h3>
          <p>Each crew works one set of neighborhoods, so they know your yard, your gate and your dog.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>A text before, a photo after</h3>
          <p>You'll know when we're coming, and see the yard when we're done even if you're not home.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>Quiet equipment</h3>
          <p>Our trimmers and blowers are battery powered. Your neighbors on a work call will thank you.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>Licensed and insured</h3>
          <p>Our fertilizer and weed control technicians are licensed by the state. Every crew is insured.</p>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band">
    <div class="wrap">
      <ul class="numbers">
        <li><strong>2015</strong>the year we started</li>
        <li><strong>4</strong>crews on the road</li>
        <li><strong>600+</strong>yards mowed each week</li>
        <li><strong>8</strong>towns in the Triangle</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .numbers {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 56rem) {
    .numbers {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    }
  }

  .numbers li {
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: var(--white);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .numbers strong {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-stretch: 85%;
    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5vw, 3.4rem);
    line-height: 1;
    color: var(--grass);
  }
</style>
